sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Agent as Chatting Agent
    participant Skill as /vista:spec-update
    participant SubAgent as Spec Update Sub-Agent
    participant FS as File System
    participant Git as Git

    User->>Agent: "We need to add a retry limit"
    Agent->>Skill: invoke spec-update(feature, topic)

    Skill->>FS: Read domain-requirements.md
    Skill->>FS: Read specs/{topic}.md
    Skill->>FS: Parse existing requirement IDs

    Skill->>User: What changed? (AskUserQuestion)
    User->>Skill: "Add retry limit of 3 for failed jobs"

    Skill->>User: Why? (AskUserQuestion)
    User->>Skill: "Edge case found during implementation"

    Skill->>SubAgent: Spawn with context + change details

    SubAgent->>FS: Read current spec file
    SubAgent->>SubAgent: Determine next ID (e.g., RMT-F12)
    SubAgent->>FS: Add requirement with ID
    SubAgent->>FS: Add changelog row
    SubAgent->>FS: Update requirement index
    SubAgent->>FS: Update acceptance criteria

    SubAgent->>Git: git add specs/{topic}.md
    SubAgent->>Git: git commit -m "spec(feature/topic): added RMT-F12"
    Git-->>SubAgent: commit hash abc1234

    SubAgent->>FS: Backfill commit hash in changelog
    SubAgent->>Git: git add + amend (backfill only)

    SubAgent->>FS: grep codebase for "RMT-" references

    SubAgent-->>Skill: Return changes + affected code
    Skill-->>Agent: Report results
    Agent-->>User: "Added RMT-F12: Retry limit of 3. No existing code references."
